  "releaseNotes": "- This is the .NET 8 implementation of FabricObserver's Extensibility library. Use this library to build .NET 8 FabricObserver and ClusterObserver plugins.\n- Fixes a bug in 3.3.1 where FabricObserver was not building plugins correctly due to a mismatch in dependency versions in the Extensibility nuspec vs csproj file.",
